  Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence (CC BY-SA 4.0,
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/), and is attributed to
  Wikipedia contributors:

    tests/fixtures/wme/records.ndjson
      Eight whole English Wikipedia article records, taken unchanged from the
      Wikimedia Enterprise snapshot enwiki_namespace_0 dated 2026-10-01 (only
      the wikitext field was removed). Each record carries its own license and
      url fields, and the url leads to the article's page history, which lists
      its authors.

    tests/fixtures/vendored_golden.json
      Test data derived from text in those articles. It is a derivative work
      and is shared under the same CC BY-SA 4.0 licence.

  If you redistribute this repository, keep these two files under CC BY-SA 4.0
